        "accession_number": "0001104659-26-034507",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-25",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We are also able to manufacture products with smooth external layers that minimize the amount of exposed polymer such that the product can be placed in contact with the viscera.",
