        "filing_date": "2026-03-25",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We are currently devoting research and development resources to develop additional variations of our OviTex and OviTex PRS products, including the development of OviTex configurations with longer-acting resorbable polymers and other potential product and packaging enhancements to extend the shelf life of our products.",
